xt consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive.py:1-11` — Preserve explicit and automatic derivation behavior plus the companion-file boundary. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py:421-424,618-632` — Preserve closed-parent reactivation and live-table coverage through the public surface; trim history. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py:1-21,139-151` — Preserve that close never compacts, explicit compaction remains, and the structural forbidden-state oracle. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_symbolic_ref_pins_3e21.py:1-16` — Preserve that any symbolic ref is resolved once and shared by verify/sign because remote-tracking refs can move concurrently. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py:1-24,277-294` — Preserve canonical code membership and the asymmetric route/document set invariant; refer to the canonical document for details. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_force_unification_blusterous.py:1-15` — Preserve canonical force spellings, audit reasons, and loud rejection of removed inputs. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_dependency_invalidation_790c.py:1-25,188-194` — Preserve own/dependency invalidation, unrelated-write tolerance, cancellation timing, and recovery guidance. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py:1-19,1245-1259,1288-1311,1501-1508,1768-1786,1810-1850` — Preserve claim certification, third-party symbol grounding, sign-on-PASS, and local-source non-certifiability; reduce each block to its local why. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py:1-14,68-72,199-210,252-261` — Preserve reviewed snapshot versus current gate ref, legacy no-pin handling, and fail-closed degraded-basis distinction. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_transition_reason_honest_3803.py:1-28` — Preserve current rule that reasons are accepted only for reason-required close classes and remain separate from force audit text. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive_heldout.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_symbolic_ref_pins_3e21.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_force_unification_blusterous.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_dependency_invalidation_790c.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_transition_reason_honest_3803.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for 